{"v":4,"catch":"帶著炸彈大鬧迷宮，突破重重難關！","desc":"《Bomb Kitten》這款復古風格的動作解謎遊戲中，扮演「炸彈貓咪」——一隻披著紅色斗篷的狡猾黑貓，炸開迷宮般的關卡，智取敵人，用炸彈清除障礙，但要小心尖刺與陷阱！\n\n收集隱藏道具，挑戰 50 個爆炸性的關卡，找到通往出口的梯子，逃出這些錯綜複雜的迷宮！\n\n• 挑戰越來越複雜的解謎關卡\n• 設置炸彈清除道路並消滅危險敵人\n• 避開陷阱，善用關卡機關\n• 在 50 個關卡中收集特殊道具","publisher":"eastasiasoft","release":"2025-11-13","genres":["益智"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/55c61541399350986663f4372ff5b3fe5d686f34b5d670bb7a69398435d6ced7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86f9ebb7b8e7b1a8b486e6da4cfe900c441334a422e728efe4fdb13774acae64.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85dabbf80b77ec780ed47f95d11ba9642d00fa3e6f5add8ea3aaf2fc8c201254.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1fa1d9077d2156ad4a96cbc4262ad4d34e21f797ce91a7ccf34e563deb884e39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3401544e605f97c41f824cf476d7be4eba08a40c055e067608ef56d04fcb184d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b0c288d12f04b962bf20c81baf3b715d4c13b699f1b79feb9fac8cb99c9a2044.jpg"],"titleId":"01006af02514e000","dlc":[]}